<title>INDIA: India RBI sets 7-year bond cut-off at 12.59 pct.</title>
<headline>India RBI sets 7-year bond cut-off at 12.59 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said it set a cut-off of 12.59 percent at an auction of seven-year bonds on Tuesday.</p>
<p>RBI said it received 310 bids for 54.50 billion rupees of which it accepted 54 (34 in full and the rest partial) for the notified amount.</p>
